      "description": "Drop. Merge. Rescue.\n\nTwo of the same animal become the next one up. A mouse and a mouse make a hamster. Two hamsters make a rabbit, and the chain keeps climbing all the way to the elephant — if you can keep the pen from spilling past the line.\n\nRESCUE A WHOLE ZOO\nEvery record you beat opens the next habitat on your map. Forty of them, each holding an animal that stays rescued for good. No timers, no energy bar, no waiting around to play again.\n\nSILVER, GOLD AND PURPLE\nMerge two of a kind and the coat steps up a grade. Silver doubles the score of any merge it joins. Gold is the step that breeds purple. And every purple animal carries a power of its own — the mouse pulls its neighbours in, the cat slams the pen flat, the bear shakes the ground, and the elephant sweeps the little ones clean away. Ten animals, ten different powers.\n\nTHREE HELPERS, ALWAYS THERE\nPen full of mice and nothing to pair? Spend your coins on a helper and drop a rabbit, a cat or a bear exactly where you need one.\n\nPLAY IT YOUR WAY\n• One thumb, portrait, anywhere\n• Left-handed layout if you want it\n• Reduce Motion for calmer effects\n• Music and sound on separate dials\n• Everything saves on your device — no account, no sign-up, nothing to remember\n\nFree to play. Watch a short ad for coins or a second chance whenever you feel like it, or pick up diamonds and Remove Ads if you would rather not watch any.",
